# Request — fold ``source_id`` into ``target_id`` (templates, outfits, facts, episodes,
# open loops), keeping the target's id and name. Explicit and audited; the engine never
# merges on its own.
string source_id
string target_id
# Optional. A caller-generated id (a uuid4) that makes a retry harmless: the node keeps
# its last 64 keys with the answer each one got and replays that answer instead of
# mutating twice. Empty means no key, and every call is a fresh mutation.
string idempotency_key
# Optional. The ``frame_stamp_ns`` of the /brain/people snapshot this call was decided
# on. When either id names a live tag whose track started after that frame, the call
# fails rather than acting on whoever holds the tag now. Empty means no check.
string decided_on_stamp_ns
---
bool success
string message
